{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi3S4fh8MGFdfxMrwr3m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For LiGa₅O₈:Ni²⁺ I get **Dq ≈ 977 cm⁻¹, B ≈ 899 cm⁻¹ and C ≈ 3130 cm⁻¹**. This uses the standard octahedral d⁸ (Ni²⁺) ligand-field model, with all energies measured from the ³A₂ ground state.\n\n**1. Dq from the ³T₂ band**\n\nThe ³A₂ → ³T₂ transition equals 10Dq exactly. So 10Dq = 9 770 cm⁻¹, which gives **Dq = 977 cm⁻¹**.\n\n**2. B from the two ³T₁ bands**\n\nThe two ³T₁ levels come from a 2×2 matrix. Relative to ³A₂ it has diagonal entries 18Dq and 15B + 12Dq, and off-diagonal entry 4Dq.\n\n- The sum of the two eigenvalues is the trace of the matrix: E(³T₁) + E(³T₁(2)) = 15B + 30Dq.\n- 16 050 + 26 740 = 42 790 cm⁻¹, so 15B = 42 790 − 29 310 = 13 480 cm⁻¹.\n- This gives **B ≈ 899 cm⁻¹**.\n\nAs a check, the product of the eigenvalues should equal the determinant, 270B·Dq + 200Dq². This gives 4.280 × 10⁸, against an observed 4.292 × 10⁸, which agrees to within 0.3 %.\n\nHowever, fitting each ³T₁ band on its own (with Dq fixed) gives a range: about 951 cm⁻¹ from the 16 050 band and 890 cm⁻¹ from the 26 740 band. The value from the sum is an average, so B is uncertain by a few tens of cm⁻¹.\n\n**3. C from the ¹E band**\n\nThe ¹E levels come from another 2×2 matrix. Relative to ³A₂ it has diagonal entries 8B + 2C and 20Dq + 9B + 2C, and off-diagonal entry 2√3·B.\n\n- Set the lower eigenvalue equal to the observed band, E = 12 987 cm⁻¹, and let d = (8B + 2C) − E.\n- The eigenvalue condition becomes d(d + 20Dq + B) = 12B², i.e. d(d + 20 439) = 9.70 × 10⁶.\n- Solving gives d ≈ 464 cm⁻¹, so 8B + 2C ≈ 13 451 cm⁻¹.\n- With 8B ≈ 7 190 cm⁻¹, 2C ≈ 6 261 cm⁻¹ and **C ≈ 3130 cm⁻¹**.\n\nThis gives C/B ≈ 3.5. Because C is obtained from B, the uncertainty in B carries over into C.\n\n{\"Dq\": 977, \"B\": 899, \"C\": 3130, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Dq from 3T2, B from the summed 3T1 energies, C from the 1E matrix eigenvalue.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":857,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":857,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f57e80a-5d63-4615-8983-b4584b326706","uuid":"1e399e42-090f-46d5-b5ae-97e0581f3271","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:26:39.110Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi3S4JNguawh9QsqRRnY"}
